{%- comment -%}
  Kolam loading screen, shown once per visit (the first page opened in a
  browser tab session) and only when Theme settings > Loading screen is on.
  Rendered first thing in <body> by layout/theme.liquid, with its own styles
  and script so it appears before the page does. A single line (a sikku kolam on a
  diamond of 25 dots, 1-3-5-7-5-3-1) is drawn around the dots, then "JVLI" fades in; it always
  lasts 3 seconds from when the drawing starts, however fast the page loads.
  The end is tied to the wordmark's animation, not a clock, because Safari can
  start the animation well after this script runs. Tapping or any key skips it. Not shown in the theme editor or to visitors who prefer
  reduced motion.
{%- endcomment -%}
